OL,3,AYour pay, energy bills and savings: How
OL,4,Athe Budget affects you
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies facing cost-of-living
OL,7,Fpressures are being offered some help,
OL,8,For "breathing space" as Chancellor John
OL,9,FHealey is calling it.
OL,11,FThe help comes as the cost of living -
OL,12,Fis rising with energy bills in
OL,13,Fparticular expected to increase by
OL,14,Falmost #300 in January.
OL,16,FHere's how the key announcements in the
OL,17,FBudget affect you and your money.
OL,19,FThe chancellor has effectively revived
OL,20,Fcost-of-living payments, by announcing
OL,21,Fa #100 automatic payment made directly
OL,22,Finto bank accounts.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
